  "_comment": "Paper figure registry. Two layers: tools = viz programs (HTML viewer + capture CLI + tool-wide defaults); figures = named instances of a tool with parameter overrides. Paths in this file are project-root-relative; fig.py / fig-web.html resolve them.",
